members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"This Suit was called in by DeFoe as part of a team of his remaining loyal Suits. Under DeFoe, they attempted to defeat Dante Vale during a Foundation mission in Velo, Greece. The team, however, was defeated and retreated under Grier. [The Treasures of the Argonauts]"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 014 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Velo, Greece, under DeFoe.\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was called in by DeFoe as part of a team of his remaining loyal Suits. Under DeFoe, they attempted to defeat Dante Vale during a Foundation mission in Velo, Greece. The team, however, was defeated and retreated under Grier. [The Treasures of the Argonauts]","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:Unnamed Suit 014.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Velo, Greece]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| first     = \"[[The Treasures of the Argonauts]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = White\n| eyes      =\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 014''' is a [[Suit]] within [[the Organization]]. He operates from  [[Velo, Greece]], under [[DeFoe]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was called in by [[DeFoe]] as part of a team of his remaining loyal Suits. Under DeFoe, they attempted to defeat [[Dante Vale]] during a [[Foundation]] mission in [[Velo, Greece]]. The team, however, was defeated and retreated under [[Grier]]. {{source|The Treasures of the Argonauts}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"Velo, Greece","label":"Velo, Greece","target_id":"huntik:page:17589","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Velo%2C_Greece","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Velo%2C%20Greece"},{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","sta